{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1305,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a30297e4b6815da1290b092f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "精神皆要健全！\r\n爸──！我没有忘记\r\n运动员的精神哦──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c7a13283f160804b874c8232e9026a0f0e548351058acee63c8dc63462abb10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40516f3bd92a268dac51023d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……哎呀？我好像想起了\r\n什么事情……又忘记了！\r\n应该不重要吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d79fb8f9d62075c5ff3d46155f696f7e7d92d6c8381ae8bd5373bcfb3b3f2a71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a74884fcd13f300173503e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是跑步还是在舞台上表演，\r\n只要能通过我的脚带给大家感动，\r\n那我就会感到非常开心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfb1f810495591d58a6f3e8d39897f06fafcdf75bc217b1b6dc21452719d5c40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56370269338a0da62fdb8a03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……直挺挺！\r\n嘿嘿，怎么样怎么样？\r\n我有像大家一样把衣服穿好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f1e57417bee4a9891f5b20662fde0218ddb894f8ceed8ce0a6a4c87bfca328d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85cd49de686c27377bde9c16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要瞬间看到了机会，\r\n我就会奋力向前冲！\r\n这就是比赛的精髓！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4485aec97577ed801a83894a4409eba19f3b5575ca1f59ab26ca742a50ce48f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:129b210b2df972a1919df56e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个胜利的图案是我小时候想的。\r\n哼哼──！很有品味吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ae3bcb8a4ad850fd8897d665c9c5ec034e0a6f32789afb4a3dac4a322c38916",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b833423f64c06111f02cb480",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "佐敦总是很早起哦！\r\n还会很用心化妆……呜喔喔！\r\n那么努力真的很了不起──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25d4bb27afa12326ca8051f9fc630d8a58138e1e043cd222d1518b936cebd836",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:719038f543e18933ee8416e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "中午的饭粒粘在衣服上，\r\n害我被后辈笑了啦！\r\n好丢脸哦──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cb53f89a5f57f9076dc7c8342bd9cd7ea6bfea06866cf999a574f246e880ab4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33db9b6be4ed755203213182",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よぉぉし！負けないぞぉ～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eeb964a4338e2d357b83c9ad3ff18d2e5466934a1215a1069f4e9187561b18d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eebe960871ab3b219b8b7d31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……晚上了啊。如、如果有鬼出现\r\n我一定要跟他说……！\r\n不准让大家害怕──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1f4dac0c4f41c29a511707cfffc46d989bd88ee13836dc2ab61a44b3ab2c79c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e7a4c7f2e03f801f2cec2d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为发现了德比特辑的杂志，\r\n害我花光了钱包里的钱！\r\n……又得向妈妈谢罪了啦──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "101c36b05905e2b5bc318e53371492b98d83360ae27ce845cea73c9fbb67046a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be3e725e56310d5c820e4981",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上遇到了大进，\r\n她今天不是只说我「吵死了」，\r\n还有回我「早安」哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9cd1e1f37df74e55e5f80016efa56add3ce18a5d3432bcc82753ed64d2cbdb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1153f920b4e5f3eef37ff63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个季节在山上跑步很愉快哦，\r\n不只景色很漂亮，还有看起来\r\n很好吃的红色蘑菇可以摘呢──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e016ad55bc0420903686e36372062baaf385200fe4a91ebc51a3dc8c23f2e28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:377870030836bf8659537024",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等一下我们来喝热可可吧！\r\n以前我妈妈常常帮我准备哦！\r\n说那是努力的奖励！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed0fe2a9ae81bfcf5206d9c25931f0d70c7e188eed0b1b16e5a82e2b9c900596",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c8f19e7b9f23b514e0f2466",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你知道动力飞行伞吗？\r\n以前我有跟爸爸一起玩过喔！\r\n操纵方式有点像在开飞机！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dc7fe71a62fba99999c2ce51bc9f652e1f155a3a691a78c5fd9a4ee117143fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff6811f3ffc99103af1b89f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个小包包？里面装着送货员名片！\r\n我给了涡轮一张，结果收到她亲手\r\n写的书法当回礼！她的字好漂亮～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22e56dd2525170bfdf4c93bfe248b6c7a9a06064b18c615f003455ddd5975e5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8a3435326297d7a2cb7cc66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我向正在游戏中修理机械的\r\n大进搭话，但她没有理我。\r\n她的专注力真的很强呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "748ef8dc103cf18a29660fed32c2df8476c51a31852a0244314be4ba0fd10345",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b196cf2bae93b91106957eef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我听不太懂游戏说明……\r\n不过遇到什么疑惑\r\n晨光都会教我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7c544569910bc72a27f0f7b086c4f74389c2a052e4368c205828dea2c828e3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29a06b2454acb3a918d14d46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好久没穿这种轻飘飘的衣服啦！\r\n以前我常穿姐姐的旧衣服，\r\n里面不少这种款式呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b171e38f0f9d8a9e7a6f69aa70548d1d965bdb66950e8af10d682b8ad0b09a1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70f14fb426759867c08eb077",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上真是神清气爽呢～！\r\n害我从宿舍走到校舍时，忍不住用\r\n后空翻和侧翻跳过路上所有障碍物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "863d78f982d47be2d5e247e7c7a1a7a9fdc90a6b83c102b748225e5926342a61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e34079dd9c0901b495077973",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔喔喔喔喔喔喔！唔喔喔喔！\r\n这时间很容易想睡，\r\n所以我在大声吶喊防止自己睡着！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78d15d5db932d699cf538ca98591fb4562140b8f16d4cdefec9a40f5dd6e841f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ff20418b4dad551d4fed851",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开着飞机不断飞高，\r\n是不是就能飞到星星上呢！\r\n……咦？你说……那是火箭才对？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f3935250cad5a3c75e9c0c83e625f1879e71d3f04eb58cc25249642676ea0b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5846ce39822fc750e16d4e39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你觉得从空中赏花怎么样？\r\n我想一定会很美！\r\n赶快打开游戏试试看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b930ff1321a4716c7b48a195f8790dc1054b79a8fab7ba40e88775df48419167",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10e033ea67f9ff413142d591",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然在这大热天里努力工作\r\n到发烫……别太勉强啊──！\r\n仪器们──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "052a48c55a96aa66991b4d4805f74d8144bc8329acc8948ecdb51d0ce511f36e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd094c3d72935ad44806e205",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不会吧！原来捡枫叶不是为了\r\n摘下枫叶炸成天妇罗来吃啊！\r\n真的假的～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "88852ea659548f579d62b7d1a82e815eb34259a4b4de6fc50c908edfdd17caa1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf89636e6942530f82459909",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦？我完全不觉得冷喔！\r\n反倒还觉得有点热……哈啾！\r\n啊哈哈，有人在偷说我坏话──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e58ec9f1c5ca47ea7ee129143bfad99d7293b5af2ddf1d45ca3e74ed1ad9b204",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e02cde9604bddfb0a5bb47fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是传递心意的送货员！\r\n没有我到达不了的地方！\r\n要送货就交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "413af8e3bade670c75482c25c048035d941ed650df70449d833e760a68007d59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:191087325935db544b4da9b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸欸，一起玩游戏嘛！我想跟\r\n训练员一起在机械城市中玩耍～！\r\n好不好嘛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "18b2568bf5fb737f096695f33249080159b12b14fe9da6dfcc5e068f45c57755",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f41a672b56a5602a591aae6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "タイシンがね、\r\n『白と色モノ一緒に回すな！』\r\nって…。洗濯、難しいよぉ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7be5fe60ab3d9f79222c8972125aeed475bcd0c0d1fab8c8efc448adc577bb53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d0a4a75ef1642e6e3745c40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "えぇー！？ヒト用の体力テスト、\r\n鉄球投げないの！？鉄球じゃ投げ\r\nても10mいかない！？ええー！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "da7475d6ae05d7806b19777b40e34e6808528d378c4d862c92624301bdd52dec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24103186bb7c5fd6a7fe0e59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "チケゾー的、着こなしポイントは…\r\n帽子とリボンのお花！！つけると\r\n背筋ピーンってなるんだ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44c5258233e22ef039c6c9086b5a2b1058855ae0100f8532011a8155a53da787",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:778e5c366b8d6801f1f06c66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なんかね！どこかに帽子をかぶった\r\nカッコいいユニットがあるん\r\nだって！アタシも入れるかな～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2efa515a79877d6260dc8056a30ce9d2c073172d93b126c57325b5b8c382adaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e2cb6997a2fc42d1007d0ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "次の『U.A.F.』サッカーも\r\n楽しみだ！またゴールネット、破け\r\nちゃったりして…大迫力、期待大！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32589912a24c5324eeca21a090fa560f58b6177eab12f6b2f1100cbb2d317553",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ed97239f2748182f209107b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "髪、今日はジョーダンに\r\n結んでもらったからさ！\r\n夕方まで絶っっ対！ほどけないよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49748965eb166bea13147f0b2bc039926b4c9d640816e634ac21572f131e88c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd1b99eadca2c319e8a2f1b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ねむい…ねむ…くない…。\r\nねむ…ねむ…ね…ね…\r\n……ねむくなーーーい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fc000069c4600581bbcf7dff334d2764fc11c7346ea8247f159c94d4ab25c07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:862358e0189440ef23f70bb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ネイチャ、ゲートボール強すぎる\r\nよ～。…でも！おばあちゃんになっ\r\nてもできるし！いつか絶対勝ーつ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a18e91dada6279d8df76e842370d86a4174afa623ecb450bc3ceed998d7622c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86257f94707f6c8933c8f722",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "すごがっだよぉ～偉がっだよぉ～！\r\n新入生ちゃんの挨拶、\r\nザイゴーだっだよぉ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22fafee4f34d86005da138115c0fcfab24f8d95b89785609d4661267258de940",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dd23c3fbd029d4e62c9b9a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふぃ～、今日も暑いな～。\r\nズボンの後ろ、\r\n涼しい素材でよかった～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00d6ad3fdb3fb16a4cb63ad245e68dffa24ec37422906a237dc72f8515f1732c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5db6ce7d403ced0b76623927",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『U.A.F.』のおかげで、\r\nスポーツの秋も大盛り上がり！\r\nアタシのモチベもギュンギュンだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04980c63324263e167ac9821a3ca8c00ca6f4bb0e7f0cacc69db12df98c26e97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26db4770690cc3429ed05d4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…あの特設スケートリンク、\r\nいつまでだっけ？ニッコニコで滑る\r\nユキちゃん、可愛かったなぁ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bfccb2a87e6976229cb96d340126a5542c6fea64153d132d8219c5d0858917c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1746261af3b16b933b71f7e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この衣装ね！実はタイシンと\r\nハヤヒデが隠れてるんだー！\r\nえへへ、どこでしょーうかっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4285c3b107b0c047b0a6a2a6114781fd736670a1279d2dcfc2b290aa7b020029",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:553db6cba9218de26c24598f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宣誓ッ！アタシ、ウイニング\r\nチケットは！これからもずっと！\r\nキミとがんばることを、誓います！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36aaa4002098f87cdb4027c9a578221e1ef5eb2e785732217b7443aa8da3c4f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a609457cade7ae5acb4a71c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好──我要上咯──！喔喔──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5dfacddde08e54e5a60f4670f5fa1ca9fe5703444f8ac47e5b9c4507bc8856c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29ea85927871f73b7dfee97d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全力だぁー！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "513e4bbf18c960d813b40ce05ce2d75179961534e52f14305991d53074a51c84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a457f3bffd81254c1bf24126",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿──无论是\r\n什么训练安排都尽管来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93c3576c4c8cae1f71ec328123c6deb666b1a67599967861a0f5ecad982f1ec8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e56bc5289f1fb07554a28956",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太棒啦──！\r\n训练的时间到了──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "68f9536198af5397fd41cca63a22ce3062ca7219d628929f32f14eacb2e52b4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e561be4a7e80ada64aa8a98b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我都已经准备好了哦！\r\n今天也麻烦你了哦，训练员！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d44a77ddc9f98414a1bb7b040f0917f872ad28594461f9dc56eb46ef2027d41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87a5729156b813b2cf551134",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天我也要\r\n让你好好看到我的进步！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7a84f8065552449c48360520224143b3a4c2f1ee7990e5e9714461eda182112",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbebaf2ce23d613064ab31d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了有一天可以\r\n一起抓住胜利的奖券！\r\n现在得要好好努力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0d4b0860eb1731b6bec34329d6f89e13a9a1f63446a111185890b986f3fbd31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:959e071e60e84c1e8e83e40e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果没有训练员帮忙，\r\n我的梦想是绝对无法实现的。\r\n今后也要一直……哇哈！好害羞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "176db41b32a3c9300c2dcc23d40d3b788aaad156e3d2569aef4e01122d609cfe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1f9f9baead86c9666dcf005",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "像这样在一旁看，\r\n就会觉得大家都很努力。\r\n我也不能输──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "da4a39e807a163c54426212a48d9092c6175941eda627e3843fff232763696dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be4c9f351655521cd6894791",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Ready to start！\r\n耶嘿嘿，我在用无线电通讯喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c932578ddaf4a42404e44327a8069eafc55d854cbfa48fa0ca1d57516b9b1dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef0adc8a9bc367a725058c6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "努力训练一定有意义！\r\n我会加油的────！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01e5fa897ef3bd57caa9631eda30fdb46ee967d34f4494ea895ad726c5d2aa20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f14c8547f819d6e1a591d17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "加油喔喔喔────！！\r\n为了实现梦想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd0fad72381754222e00209e2db2080d3412723f000f12e3b84639bdaf515735",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99e57edb15ca7abd89efae43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "努力训练的模样，\r\n或许也能为他人带来梦想！对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2104d7d8f9a0a3405db4b60bbc16001e586a30cb9643658669d85bb0948fa81a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baaf4a268e5edb14bde9a132",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论再遥远，都要紧盯梦想\r\n专心致志地向前跑！\r\n一切努力都不会白费的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "216706a14bec4ed9e69c590aa6c2bcba8b53235df7bfd9c2b6aa61ee4d026b1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5bfc19fa24c0e1d2acd0a83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使遇上险峻的高山，\r\n只要越过去就好！\r\n我现在是这么认为的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b4be5eeac9bd2f087b9583863bd82016231cdcee92357d57e667c7bb4060912",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0806438bc183d853f2f33084",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有办法为训练员送上胜利吗？\r\n不，别怀疑，\r\n我绝对会送达！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d6ea39c92a76943af1a6a373840a4d024f60457503b3bc586b46b405edfa1d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8acfb8ffde764b1c35d46a8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシの背中が、誰かの夢、\r\n誰かの憧れになるんだ。\r\n…よし！やるぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1739e583a2bcea41fd9576bfd868f2ed4e11b2810e98b0b92d2bf44eb01ac8b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd5581be5323218c34ee7e64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "みんなの先頭に立つ気持ちで！\r\n全！力！トレーニング！だぁーー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "727b9163d18bb079c80abc6f812963f1517e291d133a04476a148e285c5b53f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a1f64f5a7b3b405865f16b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帽子よし！リボンよし！全部よし！\r\n準備OK！やるぞやるぞやるぞー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92f125b3c3921c7b4ecd97160d91d97545a1ab6001bd775af1395978ea46cd04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ceabdb591a5360c712e44b29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日も全力全身で！\r\nトレーニングすることを\r\n誓いまぁーーーーっす！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d22c352dafbbbe2cd1ce643fdc4659d976cfdb1a91a1301feecaa69cd0917568",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d8de2c79903420887dea919",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うぉおおおおお！\r\nBNWの飾りをつけてるんだ！\r\n負けない！負けないぞぉーー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9676d5fb6aa7ddd023d1b65dd73707aa1c454bc3091e7f336530cb5fca22594c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d82b388751075e102b6c4ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あの日アタシが見た夢を、\r\n今度はアタシが！\r\n見せられるように！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c145412feca68dc3c900c835c4d0c08d00b8b04fb0069da468a61d97dffea4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:617b902f8490bd65d88f73b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさんを\r\n表彰台までエスコート！\r\n…できるように！がんばるぞーっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e838b76391988d3cc98b9e1a791b38f71991af618d30b9855a69d932fc1298a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4daa571943322bda8811019",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一起抓住的胜利的奖券……\r\n绝对不会放手！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a780bae8d5d0eeeb31cf9b270da50454ca2e114160250f68d4899b35f369e638",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b021c72c5a8308e2e5f3f55d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员～！真的很谢谢你啊～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3b31d47a3ad702592a8f86f8bd6ef49b8b263c67485603872404958a4bc1f60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96a79a27e0cbca65faabbd5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，以后还要\r\n继续跟我一起分送梦想喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eed8d25fa765f79c90d8b828bd20f065bd66c759baf99192a863ddc77c2682e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e33997acf67647a69b66c544",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真希望我的梦想也能传递给他人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2526d6b86150958d07fff62b393d57e3e57aa1528c1b02404dfe5f900b69ed2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:767d90561f50d1a4429467b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どれーなーざんへの恩返し、\r\nごごに誓うよぉ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "002a4ec8abb97f428d2d6f3cfb5fa0811da746abd9d9ada405901911f00fa2b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59126bf1082acef250f49443",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スポーツって、サイコーだぁー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "51f3012fef91a49e0b4d3b2e86a832dbc702ac2c91eefb21b3bc860e24a7a5b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d44cc1fee27878a2f1fb7687",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为我还在成长的巅峰期嘛！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90a114fc50d879e0057e984240c1ed989bf865190ff7e45b73c62cf2589de94b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:607e39f531db90eb8edf3a09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要超越自己！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dc473e1733d05b06ee336ea8a15c4a4eeb917a93732ab95a5085b72423eb15b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be378fd8a395ecf781cce2cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是！我叫胜利奖券！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d68570ee58f7d5e325c254de4f15ae5d0cd45d827682e16cee9fbb5eaecfec33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:140133edd9af03644996ffcf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "包在我身上吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7c75e19267337e657c0661f3a0de531e71e03160c23466faf840d3db5b85641",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cc58d8716f6ac0545f415eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会全力支持的！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9d13ff2480b752b685eb945d6256b503715803fe7c2c3a09c79ce6405b70b9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:269b45fbd017e96616b444ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "职业等级提──升！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd5b766eca505d8d7bb217cc0e86742e6b3e3ecc81861734b13b3c858c6cfece",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c327b9e32a66a301c366b74d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要成为这职业的大师！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "60f9236a5b7b661e17144879bc8dd6b60f75fae19979a54d27d6b4eb98e02119",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98e2678ec853b267c02a616b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被托付的意志……\r\n我一定会成功送达目的地！",
      "source_fingerprint": "829955a0c3904f59fb3728b784be4f81e7867fa6f26eee6c7727725db78b1929",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d77ae44ce41f694d2b7f0acc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是送货员胜利奖券！\r\n出发去递送梦想吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04572e2a192bc9cdd606f252846c7a01fc7302e3fac90ab3adbc4bba70104b33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "95010"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
